#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:2
msgid "Complete local stack"
msgstr "完整的本地环境"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Run the browser, control plane, runner, and real Agent CLIs together "
"without production accounts or credentials. This Docker topology "
"includes:"
msgstr "不需要生产账号和凭据，就能把浏览器、控制平面、runner 和真实的 Agent CLI 放在一起跑起来。这套 Docker 环境包括："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:7
msgid "the web app and a same-origin reverse proxy;"
msgstr "Web 应用，以及一个同源的反向代理；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:8
msgid ""
"a fixture Gateway serving PKCE/JWKS, account and model lookups, inference"
" grants, and deterministic model responses;"
msgstr "一个模拟网关，提供 PKCE/JWKS、账号和模型查询、推理授权，以及结果固定的模型回复；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:10
msgid "Postgres, migrations, host enrollment, and the sandbox manager;"
msgstr "Postgres、数据库迁移、主机注册和 sandbox manager；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:11
msgid ""
"the sandbox image with pinned Claude Code, Codex, Pi, OpenCode, and Kilo "
"CLIs;"
msgstr "沙箱镜像，内置固定版本的 Claude Code、Codex、Pi、OpenCode 和 Kilo CLI；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:12
msgid ""
"a read-only `local/demo` Git repository on the private control-plane "
"network."
msgstr "控制平面私有网络里的一个只读 Git 仓库 `local/demo`。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:14
msgid ""
"Authentication uses the application's normal flow: browser PKCE, RS256 "
"identity verification through JWKS, and short-lived inference grants. The"
" Gateway and Git server replace external services. The stack uses plain "
"Docker isolation for trusted development; public multi-tenant deployments"
" require Kata."
msgstr ""
"认证走的是应用正常的流程：浏览器端 PKCE、通过 JWKS 校验 RS256 身份令牌，以及短期的推理授权。只是把外部的网关和 Git "
"服务换成了本地的模拟服务。这套环境用的是普通 Docker 隔离，只适合受信任的开发场景；对公众开放的多租户部署必须用 Kata。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:19
msgid "Run"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:21
msgid ""
"Run these commands from the repository root. You need Docker 28 or newer "
"with Compose, `openssl`, `curl`, and Python 3. Docker 28 supplies the "
"gateway-priority support used when attaching relays to sandbox networks. "
"`dev.sh` prefers the Compose v2 plugin and falls back to `docker-"
"compose`."
msgstr ""
"下面的命令都在仓库根目录运行。你需要 Docker 28 或更新版本（带 Compose）、`openssl`、`curl` 和 Python "
"3。之所以要 Docker 28，是因为把中继接入沙箱网络时要用到它的网关优先级功能。`dev.sh` 优先用 Compose v2 "
"插件，没有的话就改用 `docker-compose`。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:26
msgid ""
"Give Docker Desktop at least 4 GiB of memory; 8 GiB is recommended for "
"the full smoke test. A roughly 2 GiB VM can run out of memory while "
"starting Kilo."
msgstr ""
"Docker Desktop 至少要分配 4 GiB 内存，跑完整的冒烟测试建议给 8 GiB。只有 2 GiB 左右的虚拟机，启动 Kilo "
"时可能会内存不足。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:34
msgid ""
"Open <http://127.0.0.1:13002>. The first sign-in shows a local consent "
"page. Use `127.0.0.1` consistently throughout sign-in so the login-flow "
"cookie reaches the callback."
msgstr ""
"打开 <http://127.0.0.1:13002>。第一次登录会出现一个本地的授权确认页。整个登录过程都要用 `127.0.0.1` "
"访问，否则登录流程的 cookie 到不了回调地址。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:38
msgid ""
"The first `up` builds all images, verifies the database credentials, "
"applies migrations, starts the services, and waits for readiness. "
"Installing five pinned CLIs can make the first build slow; later builds "
"reuse Docker's layer cache. The bootstrap records a deployment marker in "
"`local-host-state`, and claims use the same exact-generation fence as "
"production."
msgstr ""
"第一次运行 `up` 会构建所有镜像、核对数据库凭据、执行迁移、启动服务，并等到服务就绪。要装五个固定版本的 "
"CLI，所以第一次构建可能比较慢；之后的构建会复用 Docker 的层缓存。初始化过程会在 `local-host-state` "
"里写一个部署标记，认领任务时用的也是和生产一样的精确代次栅栏。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:44
msgid ""
"`dev.sh` generates local credentials in the git-ignored "
"`deploy/local/.env.local` with mode `0600`. Keep this file with the "
"stack's retained database. If it is missing while the Postgres volume "
"still exists, the script refuses to generate replacement credentials. "
"Restore the original file, especially `AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD` and "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`, before retrying. Existing environment files are "
"upgraded without replacing credentials or selected ports."
msgstr ""
"`dev.sh` 会把本地凭据生成到 `deploy/local/.env.local`，权限是 `0600`，这个文件已被 git "
"忽略。它要和这套环境保留的数据库一起保管：如果文件丢了，而 Postgres 卷还在，脚本会拒绝重新生成凭据。这时请先把原文件找回来，尤其是 "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD` 和 "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`，再重试。已有的环境文件会被自动升级，但其中的凭据和已选的端口不会被替换。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:51
msgid "Useful commands:"
msgstr "常用命令："

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "`./deploy/local/dev.sh status`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "List service state."
msgstr "列出各服务的状态。"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "`./deploy/local/dev.sh logs runner`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Follow a service's recent logs; omit `runner` for all services."
msgstr "持续查看某个服务的最新日志；不写 `runner` 就显示全部服务。"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "`./deploy/local/dev.sh config`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Validate Compose configuration without printing secrets."
msgstr "校验 Compose 配置，不会把 secret 打印出来。"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "`./deploy/local/dev.sh stop`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Stop service containers and retain their state."
msgstr "停止服务容器，保留它们的状态。"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "`./deploy/local/dev.sh start`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Verify credentials, apply migrations, and start existing services."
msgstr "核对凭据、执行迁移，并启动已有的服务。"

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "`./deploy/local/dev.sh up`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/local-stack.md:1
msgid "Rebuild and reconcile services after code or configuration changes."
msgstr "改了代码或配置后，重新构建并调和各服务。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:62
msgid ""
"`stop` uses Compose's `stop` command. Service containers, named volumes, "
"networks, and retained chat containers remain available. The stack has no"
" host workspace or database bind mounts. The runner and sandbox manager "
"control Docker through its socket, and Docker's data root holds the "
"retained state."
msgstr ""
"`stop` 用的是 Compose 的 `stop` "
"命令，服务容器、具名卷、网络和保留的对话容器都还在。这套环境没有把任何主机上的工作区或数据库目录绑定挂载进去：runner 和 sandbox "
"manager 通过 Docker socket 控制 Docker，保留的状态都存放在 Docker 的数据目录里。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:67
msgid "Ports and parallel stacks"
msgstr "端口与多套环境并行"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:69
msgid ""
"Set `LOCAL_EDGE_PORT` in `.env.local`, or export it before running "
"`dev.sh`, to change the browser port. Readiness checks, smoke URLs, "
"browser URLs, and the default OAuth callback allowlist follow that port. "
"An explicit `LOCAL_IDENTITY_ALLOWED_REDIRECTS` controls the allowlist "
"when testing custom identity configuration."
msgstr ""
"要改浏览器访问的端口，可以在 `.env.local` 里设置 `LOCAL_EDGE_PORT`，或者在运行 `dev.sh` "
"前导出这个变量。就绪检查、冒烟测试和浏览器用的 URL，以及默认的 OAuth "
"回调白名单，都会跟着这个端口变。如果在测试自定义的身份配置，可以显式设置 `LOCAL_IDENTITY_ALLOWED_REDIRECTS` "
"来控制白名单。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:75
msgid ""
"For a second checkout on the same Docker engine, give it distinct values "
"for all of these settings and use them for every `dev.sh` invocation:"
msgstr "在同一个 Docker 引擎上再跑第二份仓库副本时，下面这些设置都要换成不同的值，而且每次调用 `dev.sh` 都要带上："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:78
msgid ""
"`LOCAL_PROJECT_NAME`, `LOCAL_SANDBOX_IMAGE`, `AGENT_NETWORK_NAME`, and "
"`LOCAL_RELAY_NETWORK`;"
msgstr ""
"`LOCAL_PROJECT_NAME`、`LOCAL_SANDBOX_IMAGE`、`AGENT_NETWORK_NAME` 和 "
"`LOCAL_RELAY_NETWORK`；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:80
msgid "`LOCAL_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`, with no overlap with the first stack's pool;"
msgstr "`LOCAL_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`，不能和第一套环境的地址池重叠；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:81
msgid ""
"`LOCAL_EDGE_PORT`, `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_PORT`, `AGENT_MCP_RELAY_PORT`, "
"and `AGENT_WEB_PORT`."
msgstr ""
"`LOCAL_EDGE_PORT`、`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_PORT`、`AGENT_MCP_RELAY_PORT` 和 "
"`AGENT_WEB_PORT`。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:84
msgid ""
"When no sandbox image override exists, the image tag is derived from the "
"project name. An existing `.env.local` already contains an explicit tag, "
"so override it when changing that stack's project name. These settings "
"separate images, volumes, service discovery, ports, host rules, and group"
" addresses."
msgstr ""
"如果没有单独指定沙箱镜像，镜像标签会根据项目名生成。不过已有的 `.env.local` "
"里已经写死了一个标签，所以改了这套环境的项目名时，也要把标签一起改掉。这些设置让两套环境的镜像、卷、服务发现、端口、主机防火墙规则和沙箱组地址互不干扰。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:89
msgid ""
"`up`, `start`, and `smoke` refuse networks owned by another Compose "
"project before changing containers. The host rules also refuse "
"overlapping sandbox address pools; accepting Compose's network warning "
"can route traffic to the wrong stack."
msgstr ""
"`up`、`start` 和 `smoke` 在动容器之前，会先检查网络：属于另一个 Compose "
"项目的网络一律拒绝使用。主机防火墙规则也会拒绝重叠的沙箱地址池。如果无视 Compose 给出的网络警告，流量可能会被转到另一套环境里。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:94
msgid "Sandbox networking"
msgstr "沙箱网络"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:96
msgid ""
"Each retained sandbox group gets a routable, labelled `freeinference-"
"chat-net-*` bridge. Before a sandbox joins it, the runner or sandbox "
"manager installs and verifies this stack's nftables rules on the Docker "
"engine. The rules allow public IPv4 on TCP 80/443, DNS through "
"`LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` on TCP/UDP 53, and that group's inference and "
"MCP relays on their service ports. They block the engine's own addresses,"
" private and special-purpose ranges, other groups, other ports, and IPv6."
msgstr ""
"每个保留的沙箱组都有一个可路由、带标签的 `freeinference-chat-net-*` 网桥。沙箱接入之前，runner 或 "
"sandbox manager 会先在 Docker 引擎上安装这套环境的 nftables 规则，并确认已经生效。规则只放行三类流量：TCP "
"80/443 上的公网 IPv4；通过 `LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` 走 TCP/UDP 53 的 "
"DNS；以及访问本组推理中继和 MCP 中继服务端口的流量。引擎自身的地址、私有和特殊用途的地址段、其他沙箱组、其他端口以及 IPv6 全部拦截。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:104
msgid ""
"The relay network is used to discover the two relays; sandboxes never "
"join it. This is the same network policy used in production. On first "
"configuration, `dev.sh` records a non-loopback IPv4 resolver supplied by "
"the Docker engine (for example, Colima's `192.168.5.1`), falling back to "
"`1.1.1.1` if none is found. Change `LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` if that "
"resolver is unavailable in your setup."
msgstr ""
"中继网络只用来找到那两个中继，沙箱永远不会接入它。这和生产环境用的是同一套网络策略。第一次配置时，`dev.sh` 会记下 Docker "
"引擎提供的一个非回环 IPv4 DNS 解析器（比如 Colima 的 `192.168.5.1`）；找不到就用 "
"`1.1.1.1`。如果你的环境里这个解析器用不了，改一下 `LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` 即可。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:110
msgid "Building through a local proxy"
msgstr "通过本地代理构建"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:112
msgid ""
"On Docker Desktop, builds can reach a proxy on the host through "
"`host.docker.internal`. Start the proxy, prebuild with Docker's standard "
"proxy arguments, then reuse those images:"
msgstr ""
"在 Docker Desktop 上，构建过程可以通过 `host.docker.internal` 访问本机上的代理。先把代理启动起来，用 "
"Docker 标准的代理参数预先构建镜像，然后直接复用："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:124
msgid ""
"Use the same project, image, network, and port overrides for both "
"commands. Re-run `build` after code changes before using `up --no-build`."
" Proxy arguments apply to build downloads; they do not configure a "
"runtime sandbox proxy. Certificate and package-signature verification "
"remain enabled."
msgstr ""
"两条命令要用同一套项目、镜像、网络和端口设置。改了代码之后，先重新跑 `build`，再用 `up --no-"
"build`。代理参数只影响构建时的下载，不会给运行中的沙箱配置代理。证书校验和软件包签名校验照常开启。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:129
msgid ""
"Python downloads allow 120 seconds of inactivity by default. For slow "
"links, override `PIP_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT` and the runner's `UV_HTTP_TIMEOUT` "
"build arguments. For Debian mirror failures, add a build argument such as"
" `--build-arg DEBIAN_MIRROR=http://mirrors.aliyun.com`; the default is "
"`http://deb.debian.org`. This changes archive and security mirror URLs "
"while keeping the distribution, components, and signed keyring. Index "
"downloads retry and fail the build if still unavailable. Sandbox Debian "
"and npm downloads use BuildKit caches, which are never mounted into "
"running sandboxes."
msgstr ""
"Python 下载默认在 120 秒没有数据传输时超时。网络慢的话，可以调大 `PIP_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT` 构建参数，以及 "
"runner 的 `UV_HTTP_TIMEOUT`。Debian 软件源出问题时，加一个类似 `--build-arg "
"DEBIAN_MIRROR=http://mirrors.aliyun.com` 的构建参数，默认是 "
"`http://deb.debian.org`。它只会替换主仓库和安全更新的镜像源地址，发行版、组件和签名密钥环都不变。索引下载会自动重试，还是失败就让构建报错。沙箱构建时的"
" Debian 和 npm 下载用的是 BuildKit 缓存，这些缓存永远不会挂载进运行中的沙箱。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:138
msgid "What the smoke test covers"
msgstr "冒烟测试测了什么"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:140
msgid ""
"`smoke` logs in through PKCE and exercises all five real CLI binaries. "
"For each runtime it verifies:"
msgstr "`smoke` 会通过 PKCE 登录，然后把五个真实的 CLI 都跑一遍。每个运行时都要验证："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:143
msgid "A first turn is `NEW`, followed by a `LIVE` native-session turn."
msgstr "第一轮是 `NEW`，第二轮是复用原生会话的 `LIVE`。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:144
msgid ""
"Idle stop and a `RESTORED` third turn preserve the same mount-free "
"container."
msgstr "空闲停止之后，第三轮是 `RESTORED`，用的仍是同一个没有挂载的容器。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:145
msgid ""
"A native Fork at turn two contains exactly that historical prefix, while "
"the source already has turn three."
msgstr "在第二轮处做原生 Fork，得到的对话正好只包含到第二轮为止的历史，而源对话此时已经有了第三轮。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:147
msgid ""
"Source and child remain independently `LIVE` in the shared container and "
"workspace. Both turns reach `RUNNING`, and their CLI processes overlap at"
" a two-party inference barrier before either receives a response."
msgstr ""
"源对话和 Fork 出的子对话共用一个容器和工作区，各自保持 `LIVE`。两边的轮次都会进入 `RUNNING`，而且两个 CLI "
"进程会同时卡在一个需要双方都到达的推理屏障上，之后才有任何一方收到回复。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:150
msgid ""
"The stopped group restores from the child, and the final quiescent "
"publication snapshot completes."
msgstr "已停止的沙箱组从子对话恢复，最后在静止状态下拍的发布快照顺利完成。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:153
msgid ""
"The runner defaults to two concurrent turns. `LOCAL_HOST_SLOTS` must be "
"at least 2 for this test; the admin Servers page can also change capacity"
" while the stack runs. The local idle timeout is 15 seconds, compared "
"with production's default 1800 seconds. Active turns are never stopped by"
" this idle clock."
msgstr ""
"runner 默认同时跑两个轮次。这个测试要求 `LOCAL_HOST_SLOTS` 至少为 2；环境运行期间也可以在管理后台的 Servers "
"页面调整容量。本地的空闲超时是 15 秒，生产默认是 1800 秒。正在运行的轮次不会因为这个空闲计时被停掉。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:158
msgid "Trying interactions during a turn"
msgstr "在轮次进行中试试各种交互"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:160
msgid ""
"The fixture model normally responds immediately. Add `[local-hold:N]` to "
"the current turn's message to delay its answer by up to 120 seconds. "
"During that time, try queuing, editing, or deleting waiting messages, or "
"pressing Stop. A marker in an earlier message does not delay the current "
"turn."
msgstr ""
"模拟模型平时会马上回复。在当前这一轮的消息里加上 `[local-hold:N]`，就能让回复最多推迟 120 "
"秒。趁这段时间，可以试试把消息排进队列、编辑或删除等待中的消息，或者点 Stop。之前消息里的标记不会让当前这一轮延迟。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:165
msgid ""
"Claude Code receives an injected waiting message while a tool is in "
"flight. Add `[local-tool:N]` to make it run `sleep N` through Bash first,"
" for up to 60 seconds, then press ↑ on a waiting message while that tool "
"runs. The answer after the tool quotes the injected message. Codex can "
"receive a waiting message at any point, so `[local-hold:N]` is sufficient"
" there."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 会在工具执行期间收到插入的等待消息。加上 `[local-tool:N]`，它会先通过 Bash 执行 `sleep "
"N`（最多 60 秒）；趁这个工具还在跑，在一条等待消息上按 ↑。工具跑完后的回复会引用那条插入的消息。Codex 随时都能接收等待消息，所以用 "
"`[local-hold:N]` 就够了。"

